0082DE  1  90 06                      bcc StartWorld1             ;if not, don't load continue function's world number
0082E0  1  AD FD 07                   lda ContinueWorld           ;load previously saved world number for secret
0082E3  1  20 0E 83                   jsr GoContinue              ;continue function when pressing A + start
