00836B  1               DemoEngine:
00836B  1  AE 17 07               ldx DemoAction         ;load current demo action
00836E  1  AD 18 07               lda DemoActionTimer    ;load current action timer
008371  1  D0 0D                  bne DoAction           ;if timer still counting down, skip
008373  1  E8                     inx
008374  1  EE 17 07               inc DemoAction         ;if expired, increment action, X, and
008377  1  38                     sec                    ;set carry by default for demo over
008378  1  BD 54 83               lda DemoTimingData-1,x ;get next timer
00837B  1  8D 18 07               sta DemoActionTimer    ;store as current timer
00837E  1  F0 0A                  beq DemoOver           ;if timer already at zero, skip
008380  1  BD 3F 83     DoAction: lda DemoActionData-1,x ;get and perform action (current or next)
008383  1  8D FC 06               sta SavedJoypad1Bits
