0083A0  1  AD 72 07           lda OperMode_Task
0083A3  1  20 04 8E           jsr JumpEngine
0083A6  1               
0083A6  1  EC CF              .word BridgeCollapse
0083A8  1  B0 83              .word SetupVictoryMode
