00858B  1               InitScreen:
00858B  1  20 20 82           jsr MoveAllSpritesOffscreen ;initialize all sprites including sprite #0
00858E  1  20 19 8E           jsr InitializeNameTables    ;and erase both name and attribute tables
008591  1  AD 70 07           lda OperMode
