009224  1               SetupGameOver:
009224  1  A9 00              lda #$00                  ;reset screen routine task control for title screen, game,
009226  1  8D 3C 07           sta ScreenRoutineTask     ;and game over modes
009229  1  8D 22 07           sta Sprite0HitDetectFlag  ;disable sprite 0 check
00922C  1  A9 02              lda #GameOverMusic
00922E  1  85 FC              sta EventMusicQueue       ;put game over music in secondary queue
009230  1  EE 74 07           inc DisableScreenFlag     ;disable screen output
009233  1  EE 72 07           inc OperMode_Task         ;set secondary mode to 1
