009BDD  1               ;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
009BDD  1               ;$06-$07 - used to store block buffer address used as indirect
009BDD  1               
009BDD  1               BlockBufferAddr:
009BDD  1  00 D0              .byte <Block_Buffer_1, <Block_Buffer_2
009BDF  1  05 05              .byte >Block_Buffer_1, >Block_Buffer_2
