00BCB3  1               GrowThePowerUp:
00BCB3  1  A5 09                   lda FrameCounter           ;get frame counter
00BCB5  1  29 03                   and #$03                   ;mask out all but 2 LSB
00BCB7  1  D0 19                   bne ChkPUSte               ;if any bits set here, branch
