00C0C2  1  8D 3A 07           sta EnemyObjectPageLoc    ;and enemy object page control
00C0C5  1  B9 F8 9B           lda AreaDataOfsLoopback,y ;adjust area object offset based on
00C0C8  1  8D 2C 07           sta AreaDataOffset        ;which loop command we encountered
