00CCC7  1               ;$00 - used as counter for firebar parts
00CCC7  1               ;$01 - used for oscillated high byte of spin state or to hold horizontal adder
00CCC7  1               ;$02 - used for oscillated high byte of spin state or to hold vertical adder
00CCC7  1               ;$03 - used for mirror data
00CCC7  1               ;$04 - used to store player's sprite 1 X coordinate
00CCC7  1               ;$05 - used to evaluate mirror data
00CCC7  1               ;$06 - used to store either screen X coordinate or sprite data offset
00CCC7  1               ;$07 - used to store screen Y coordinate
00CCC7  1               ;$ed - used to hold maximum length of firebar
00CCC7  1               ;$ef - used to hold high byte of spinstate
00CCC7  1               
00CCC7  1               ;horizontal adder is at first byte + high byte of spinstate,
00CCC7  1               ;vertical adder is same + 8 bytes, two's compliment
00CCC7  1               ;if greater than $08 for proper oscillation
00CCC7  1               FirebarPosLookupTbl:
