00CE7E  1  48                    pha
00CE7F  1  20 2C D9              jsr InjurePlayer         ;perform sub to hurt or kill player
00CE82  1  68                    pla
00CE83  1  85 00                 sta $00                  ;get value of $00 from stack
00CE85  1  68           NoColFB: pla                      ;get OAM data offset
00CE86  1  18                    clc                      ;add four to it and save
