00DF57  1  30 28               bmi ExIPM                 ;branch to invert bit and leave
00DF59  1  A9 FF               lda #$ff                  ;otherwise load A with value to be used later
00DF5B  1  4C 66 DF            jmp NXSpd                 ;and jump to affect movement
00DF5E  1  A2 02        RImpd: ldx #$02                  ;return $02 to X
