00E0F6  1  4C FC E0                  jmp SetD6Ste              ;jump ahead of this part
00E0F9  1  B9 B9 DF     GetSteFromD: lda EnemyBGCStateData,y   ;load new enemy state with old as offset
00E0FC  1  95 1E        SetD6Ste:    sta Enemy_State,x         ;set as new state
