00E143  1               
00E143  1               PlayerEnemyDiff:
00E143  1  B5 87              lda Enemy_X_Position,x  ;get distance between enemy object's
00E145  1  38                 sec                     ;horizontal coordinate and the player's
00E146  1  E5 86              sbc Player_X_Position   ;horizontal coordinate
00E148  1  85 00              sta $00                 ;and store here
00E14A  1  B5 6E              lda Enemy_PageLoc,x
00E14C  1  E5 6D              sbc Player_PageLoc      ;subtract borrow, then leave
00E14E  1  60                 rts
