00EF34  1               FindPlayerAction:
00EF34  1  20 EC EF           jsr ProcessPlayerAction       ;find proper offset to graphics table by player's actions
00EF37  1  4C 45 EF           jmp PlayerGfxProcessing       ;draw player, then process for fireball throwing
00EF3A  1               
00EF3A  1               DoChangeSize:
00EF3A  1  20 B0 F0           jsr HandleChangeSize          ;find proper offset to graphics table for grow/shrink
00EF3D  1  4C 45 EF           jmp PlayerGfxProcessing       ;draw player, then process for fireball throwing
